Hope the quality and price of domestically produced goods could be better, many things are domestically made, but after going out shopping and bringing them back, they are cheaper than buying domestically, hope to improve.
Buying something that has been opened by someone else
Having to pay over 100 yuan in taxes for over 300 machines is indeed quite high, but now that it's around 600, it feels much more balanced in my mind.
Upon opening it, the packing tape looked very tampered with, as if it had been opened. I took photos right away, and indeed it was just ripped open. Upon opening, there were damages to the inner cardboard box. I was worried that it might be returned by someone, and so I tried it on my husband before the anniversary date. The result was that the machine had no electricity at all. Thankfully, the blades inside were not clogged with debris; otherwise, how would we be able to return it from afar?
It is not known whether it will work well or if there might be any problems in the short term. As with previous reviews, items that were shipped when out of stock turned out to be unreliable!
Things are fine, but Amazon's after-sales service is really much worse than other sites.
After placing the order, I found that I had ordered the wrong item, but the order cannot be canceled anymore. Trying to contact online customer service via the webpage keeps showing an incorrect link and I can't reach them.
After delivery, the delivery person called me and said I didn't want it anymore; I wanted to cancel the order but it wasn't successful. The delivery person took it back and said they would sign for it first so that I could apply for a return.
When applying for a return, the food group was informed that it would not be possible to return the goods once the receipt had been signed and that it would not be possible to call the Amazon passenger service, and the same was true of the claim that the receipt could not be returned.
I have bought items that cannot be returned under policy from both JD and Suning before, including milk and diapers, and contacted customer service in both cases where they were able to get a refund. Even for diapers from JD that had an overwhelming odor after opening, I was able to get a refund through customer service. However, at Amazon, this doesn't work for me.
The rules are dead, people are alive. How did you handle contacting your customer service?
Tell me to either take it myself or let the delivery person buy it themselves. After all, delivery people don't have an easy job; why should I expect them to pay for something they didn't purchase?
Okay, I won’t back out either. I’ll accept it myself, but I have to give your service a rating of 1 out of 5.
Amazon's own should not be selling such products.
Buy during product sales when the price is not low; it's also a good product based on reviews.
Upon receiving the actual product, I was stunned. The surface of the item had extensive wear and tear, and there were other areas of wear and tear as well. It was either a second-hand item or old, and I will post some pictures later.
I am returning the product, and after seeing the pictures, the personnel from the manufacturer said it was due to transportation damage. Isn't this just making things up?
How could goods possibly wear out internally?
There are only two possibilities: either defective or used items, or I intentionally damaged the product and returned it.
Objectively, I have no evidence to prove that I damaged the product, but considering my shopping record on Amazon, I believe such a product should not be in Amazon's own-brand items. Customers choose Amazon's own-brand because they trust it; customer wins, we win, the victory of the customer is also the victory of the manufacturer. Let's all work together to improve this. Thank you.
Very satisfied with the watch.
It's definitely genuine; I've checked the authenticity at the boutique. The appearance of the watch is very nice, and the workmanship is meticulous with ample materials. With an imported mechanical movement, it has some weight to it, which cannot be compared to those 300-400 yuan so-called mechanical watches. This one is of true value and quality.
The watch is accurate; the error is within acceptable limits. A certificate of jewelry appraisal is included in the packaging, and at 12 o'clock on the dial is real diamond. This piece is very suitable to wear and is also highly prestigious as a gift to give out.
Bentley watch is indeed good.
